 "_unassigned_on_purpose": "The nulls above are species with NO group in the source table and no honest nearest neighbour: ratites (ostrich, emu, greater-rhea) do not fly at all; bustards, turaco, hoatzin, hornbill, toucan, macaw, roller, hoopoe, cuckoo, sandgrouse, roadrunner, secretary-bird, frigatebird and sunbittern have no line in a 19-group table built from 88 north-temperate species. Guessing a group for them would be exactly the error refs/species-latin.json exists to prevent, so they are reported as unmeasured rather than fitted against the nearest-looking row."
